## 🛠️ Setup

### 📦 Install dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

### 🔗 Generate API client

Make sure the backend is running at `{{ backend_url }}`, then run:

```bash
npm run generate-api
```

This generates the TypeScript client in `src/client/` from the backend's OpenAPI spec.

## ▶️ Run locally

```bash
npm run dev
```

App will be available at [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080).

